sequenceDiagram
    participant Mode as SKILL.md (any of 4 modes)
    participant Migrate as migrate_bundle.py
    participant Viewer as viewer/index.html
    participant BundleJson as bundle.json
    participant Story as data/story.json
    participant Guard as run_guard() + harvest_authored()

    Mode->>Migrate: uv run migrate_bundle.py --bundle-dir <bundle-dir>

    Migrate->>Viewer: refresh_viewer() content-compares against plugin's copy
    Migrate-->>Mode: "refreshed" or "unchanged" (unconditional, no version gate)

    Migrate->>BundleJson: read bundle_format
    Migrate->>Migrate: run_layout_ladder() steps LAYOUT_MIGRATIONS from current_format

    Migrate->>Story: read meta.schema_version (source of truth, not bundle.json's mirror)
    Migrate->>Migrate: run_data_ladder(story, current_schema)

    loop each SCHEMA_MIGRATIONS step, e.g. migrate_1_0_to_1_1
        Migrate->>Guard: run_guard(story, migrate_fn, touches)
        Guard->>Guard: harvest_authored(story) before deepcopy
        Guard->>Guard: migrate_fn(deepcopy(story))
        Guard->>Guard: harvest_authored(result) after
        alt authored field changed outside declared touches set
            Guard-->>Migrate: violations (sorted dotted paths)
            Migrate-->>Mode: error "changed authored content it did not declare" — nothing written
        else no violations
            Guard-->>Migrate: migrated story, schema advances (e.g. 1.0 to 1.1)
        end
    end

    Migrate->>Story: back up to .migration-backup/<date>-schema-<old>.json, then write story.json + story.js
    Migrate->>BundleJson: write bundle_format, schema_version, generator_version, migrated_at
    Migrate-->>Mode: report viewer / layout / data steps applied
